# Code Style

## Components
- All components are client components (`'use client'`) — needed for interactivity and Web Audio
- Use `useInstrument()` hook for instrument-aware components, never hardcode tunings or string counts
- Modals use overlay + modal pattern with ESC key handler and backdrop click to close

## Styling
- All styles go in `app/globals.css` — do not create separate CSS files
- Use CSS variables and rgba for transparency
- Mobile breakpoint is 768px
- Dark theme throughout (dark backgrounds, white/light text)

## State Management
- React Context for global state (instrument selection)
- Cookies for persistence (no database yet — Supabase integration planned)
- Local component state for UI toggles

## Fretboard Rendering
- Fretboards are pure inline SVG, no canvas or external libs
- Each fretboard variant (main, comparison, progression) has its own SVG wood grain pattern with a unique ID to avoid conflicts
- Note positions calculated from tuning array and scale formulas in `app/lib/scales.ts`
